---
// The lesson's short video. No narration in v1: text on screen, plus Hebrew
// subtitles as a WebVTT track (shown by default) so narration can be added later
// without re-producing. The script sits under the player.
interface Props {
  src: string;
  captions: string;
  poster?: string;
  minutes: string;
}
const { src, captions, poster, minutes } = Astro.props;
---

<figure class="my-6">
  <video class="w-full rounded-lg border border-n200 bg-navy shadow-sm" controls preload="metadata" playsinline poster={poster}>
    <source src={src} type="video/mp4" />
    <track kind="subtitles" srclang="he" label="עברית" src={captions} default />
    הדפדפן לא מציג וידאו. התסריט המלא נמצא מתחת.
  </video>
  <figcaption class="mt-2 text-caption text-n600">סרטון, כ־{minutes} דקות. בלי קול: הטקסט על המסך, וכתוביות בעברית.</figcaption>
  <details class="mt-2 rounded-md border border-n200 bg-n0 p-3 text-body-m text-n700">
    <summary class="cursor-pointer text-n900">התסריט המלא</summary>
    <div class="mt-2 [&>p]:my-2"><slot /></div>
  </details>
</figure>
